  "statement": "# Another Gentleman's Adventure — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nGuide a character through a whimsical side-view adventure, overcome traversal and interaction obstacles, and reach a proper ending.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact 2D adventure-platformer with a coherent route, at least one meaningful interaction beyond walking, failure/recovery, and completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the route, interactions, hazards, dialogue-light presentation, and asset composition.\n"
